00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:55,200
Stop looking at screen time several hours before bed

00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:58,920
because watching a screen like a computer screen

00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:02,680
or your phone screen or a television screen,

00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:06,640
the screens are functioning at a very high hertz.

00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:11,080
60, 50 to 60 hertz is what they're functioning at.

00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:15,120
That is a training your brain at 50 to 60 hertz.

00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:17,720
Your brain waves are only supposed to be functioning

00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:21,440
at the highest hertz of about 28 hertz,

00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:23,280
which is a high beta wave.

00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:27,120
So you're training your brain at a super high beta wave.

00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:29,000
Of course, your brain can go that high,

00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,400
but you're in training your brain to be a high beta wave.

00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,760
Nobody can fall asleep in a high beta wave.

00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:38,520
You have to get down to a theta wave to get to sleep somewhere

00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:43,120
between five and 15 hertz to be able to start to fall asleep.

00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:47,000
So it's difficult to be looking at your phone

00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,280
and it's time to go to bed.

00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,720
So you put your phone by your side of your bed

00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:52,840
and you try to go to sleep.

00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,640
That itself doesn't allow your brain

00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:57,080
to get to a theta wave to get to sleep.

00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,600
That itself could be a problem.

00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:01,880
So number one, you can't fall asleep.

00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:06,880
Stop using screens several hours before you go to bed.

00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:10,840
