00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:17,600
is there a little teeny gland in your brain

00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:20,040
called your PDL gland that's supposed

00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:23,400
to be secreting melatonin at the time

00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:25,040
before you're supposed to go to sleep.

00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:27,120
