00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:14,200
this is why if you have ever been under a lot of stress,

00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:16,600
it's difficult for you to fall asleep.

00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:20,960
So it is because if you have a lot of stress,

00:04:20,960 --> 00:04:25,200
